    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu yabayiza omukazi owundi, eriina lye nga ni Ketura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuzaalira Zimurani, ni Yokoshani, ni Medani, ni Midiani, ni Ishibaki era ni Shua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yokoshani yazaala Sheba ni Dedani. Abaana ba Dedani ni bano: Ashurimi, ni Letushimi, ni Leunimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Midiani ni bano: Efa, ni Eferi, ni Hanoka, ni Abida, ni Elida. Abo boonaboona baidhukulu ba Ketura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu yalekera Isaaka ebintu byonabyona bye yali nabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Aburahamu oyo bweyali ng'akaali mulamu, yagha abaana be ab'abakazi ab'embali ebirabo. Yabasindika mu nsi ey'e buvandhuba, bave aghali omwana we oyo Isaaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu yaghangaala emyaka kikumi na nsanvu n'etaanu (175), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era yaafa nga musaadha mukaire ow'emyaka emiidhuvu; yaatwalibwa eri badhaadha be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabane be, Isaaka ni Ishimaeli, baamuziika mu mpuku ya Makipela e buvandhuba bwa Mamure, mu nimiro eyali ey'Efuroni, omwana wa Zohara Omuhitti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo n'enimiro Aburahamu ye yagula ku Bahitti era omwo mwe yaaziikibwa ni mukazi we Sara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburahamu bweyamala okufa, Katonda yaagha Isaaka enkabi. Isaaka yaabanga kumpi ni Beerilahairoi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano ni baidhukulu ba Ishimaeli omwana wa Aburahamu eyamuzaalirwa Hagari Omumisiri eyali omwiru wa Sara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gano n'amaina gaibwe nga bwe bairaganwaku mu kuzaalibwa kwaibwe: Omwana omuberi, ni Nebaiothi, memale kwairaku Kedari, ni Adubeeli, ni Mibusamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni Mishima, ni Duma, ni Massa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni Hadadi, ni Tema, ni Yeturi, ni Nafishi, era ni Kedema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo n'abaana ba Ishimaeli, nga badhaadha ba bika ikumi na bibiri. Era ebyalo byaibwe, n'ebifo mwe baasimba weema dhaibwe byatuumibwa amaina gaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishimaeli yaghangaala emyaka kikumi n'asatu na musanvu (137), yaafa era yatwalibwa eri badhaadha be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baidhukulu ba Ishimaeli baabanga mu kiketezo ekiri ghagati gha Havila ni Shuri, e buvandhuba bwa Misiri, ng'oja mu Assiria. Baabanga eyo nga beeswireku akata ku baidhukulu ba Aburahamu abandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano n'abaana ba Isaaka omwana wa Aburahamu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka bweyagheza emyaka amakumi ana (40) egy'obukulu, yaabayiza mughala wa Bethueli Omuarami ow'e Paddanarama, ayetebwa Rebekka, mwanhina Labani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka yaasabira mukazi we, eyali omugumba. Musengwa Katonda yairamu okusaba kwe, Rebekka yaatoola enda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enda eyo yali ya balongo, era bwe baali nga bakaali kuzaalibwa, baakontaganira mule mu nda ye. Rebekka yaakoba ati: “Oba nga kiti bwekiri, kingasa ki okusigala nga ndi mulamu?” Agho yaaja okwebuuzaaku ku Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaamukoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho enaku edh'okuzaala dhaatuuka nga bwenebwene ali n'abaana balongo mu nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuberi yaafuluma ng'omubiri gwe gwa kasaayisaayi era nga gwidhwire buviiri ng'oti luwu; kale baamutuuma eriina Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owokubiri yaafuluma, ng'omukono gwe gugemereire ekibbonge kya Esau kale baamutuuma eriina Yakobo. Rebekka yaja okuzaala nga Isaaka agheziiza emyaka nkaaga (60) egy'obukulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisuka abo bombi baakula. Esau yaafuuka omuyiizi omukugu, era omusaadha anhumirwa obulamu obw'omu nsiko. Aye Yakobo yaaba musaadha musirise, era eyasigalanga ghaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka yasinga kwenda Esau, kuba yalyanga ku nsolo Esau dhe yayiiganga. Aye Rebekka yaasinga kwenda Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
